            "tips": [
                "Always check for the 'Ambiguous Case' of the Sine Rule. When you are given Side-Side-Angle (SSA) and finding an angle $\\theta$, remember that $\\sin(180^\\circ - \\theta) = \\sin \\theta$. There might be two possible triangles!"
            ],
            "tips_zh": [
                "總是檢查正弦公式的「含糊情況」。當給定 邊-邊-角 (SSA) 並求角度 $\\theta$ 時，請記住 $\\sin(180^\\circ - \\theta) = \\sin \\theta$。可能存在兩個符合條件的三角形！"
            ],
