            "tips": [
                "If you know all three sides (SSS) and need to find all angles, use the Cosine Rule to find the LARGEST angle first (the one opposite the longest side). This naturally handles obtuse angles (since $\\cos \\theta$ is negative for obtuse angles) and prevents the Ambiguous Case if you switch to the Sine Rule later."
            ],
            "tips_zh": [
                "如果已知三邊 (SSS) 並需要求所有角，請先使用餘弦公式求出最大角（最長邊對應的角）。這能自然處理鈍角（因為鈍角的 $\\cos \\theta$ 為負），並且防止之後轉用正弦公式時出現含糊情況。"
